{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Anūpama","html":"<article id='thag2.47'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 2.47 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 2.47 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Dukanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Twos </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Pañcamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Five </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Anūpamattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Anūpama </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Nandamānāgataṁ cittaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The conceited mind, addicted to pleasure, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sūlamāropamānakaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>impales itself on its own stake. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tena teneva vajasi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>It always goes where </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>yena sūlaṁ kaliṅgaraṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>there’s a stake, a chopping board. </span></span></p>\n<p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tāhaṁ cittakaliṁ brūmi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I declare you the loser mind! </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>taṁ brūmi cittadubbhakaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I declare you the insidious mind! </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Satthā te dullabho laddho, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>You’ve found the Teacher so hard to find—</span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>mānatthe maṁ niyojayī”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>don’t lead me away from the goal. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Anūpamo thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
